│  8 tokens in. every token out costs real compute.

┌─ L2 · GPU — the machine your question now lives in ───────────────────────────────────────
│  H100 · 80 GB HBM3 · ~700 W · 3.35 TB/s
│  weights: 8B × 2 bytes = 14.9 GiB resident, loaded once at boot. never reload.
│  KV cache pool: 24.4 GiB (128 KiB/token × 200k) — the context window IS spare VRAM.
